                    "line": 368,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "`std::string::insert` can throw exception, but the method has a `noexcept` specifier. This API should have a `try` `catch` block."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/common_utility.hpp",
