                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "I tested with empty variable and empty path to insert. not throwing any error.\nStill as library says it can throw error, added try-catch block."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/common_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 368,
                    "reviewer": {
